# Build context hygiene. The importer cache alone is ~193 MB and would be shipped to the daemon
# on every build without this.
.git
.gitignore
docs/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
data/importers/cache/
data/importers/__pycache__/
data/staged/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.md
!README.md
.github/
deploy.sh
compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yml
